# Unit cube centred on the origin.
# Positions only, no normals or texcoords, and one smoothing group so the generated normals are
# averaged per corner rather than per face. That keeps the mesh at exactly 8 vertices; without
# the group the importer flat shades and splits every corner three ways for 24.
# Six quad faces triangulate to 36 indices.
o box

v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v 0.5 0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 0.5
v 0.5 -0.5 0.5
v 0.5 0.5 0.5
v -0.5 0.5 0.5

s 1
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 4 3 2
f 1 5 8 4
f 2 3 7 6
f 4 8 7 3
f 1 2 6 5
